OL,4,CCan England break boom-bust          W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GWe have been here before of course.  W5
OL,7,                                      W5
OL,8,GTwelve months ago, as today, England W5
OL,9,Gtook a famous win over New Zealand.  W5
OL,10,                                      W5
OL,11,GAfter a run of victories against     W5
OL,12,Glesser opponents, it was the litmus  W5
OL,13,Gtest of their progress. They passed  W5
OL,14,Gwith flying colours and a            W5
OL,15,Gcomfortable scoreline.               W5
OL,16,                                      W5
OL,17,GIt was a statement victory, a sign   W5
OL,18,Gof things to come. England were      W5
OL,19,Gbuilding into world-beaters.         W5
